    "description": "Django's documented default: transaction.atomic() for the outer transaction and a nested transaction.atomic() for the savepoint, PostgreSQL backend, psycopg 3, CONN_MAX_AGE 0, no connection pool. TX-03 is not run in this mode. The default closes the database connection at the end of each request (not-applicable-by-design for handing a transactionally active connection to later work). https://docs.djangoproject.com/en/6.1/ref/databases/#persistent-connections",
